Non-profit association for public benefit aimed at regional, national, and transnational development, with a focus on thematic areas according to strategic documents. The priority areas for the development of the association are:
- Science, innovation, and modern technologies &ndash; creative and recreational industries;
- Investment in human resources;
- Low-carbon economy, green investments, circular economy; integrated development of urban, rural, and coastal areas;
- Cross-border and trans-regional development;
- Tourism and wellness;
- Chemical products and technologies.
